-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
herdr colour palettes (Apache License 2.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/theme.rs contains colour palettes and theme name aliases ported from herdr
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), files src/app/state.rs and
src/config/theme.rs at v0.9.0. Copyright the herdr authors. Licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Changes: the palette values and aliases were re-expressed as Rust constants
and a lookup function for codeMap's own theme resolution.

