-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Other Rust crates
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Binaries also include ratatui, crossterm, serde, serde_json, toml,
unicode-width, libc and their dependencies, under the MIT or Apache-2.0
licenses (Unicode-3.0 for Unicode data tables). Cargo.lock lists the exact
versions; `cargo deny check licenses`, configured in deny.toml, enforces the
allowed licenses in CI.

